Package: atophttpd
Version: ATOP_VERSION
Architecture: ATOPHTTPD_ARCH
Maintainer: zhenwei pi <pizhenwei@bytedance.com>
Installed-Size: ATOPHTTPD_SIZE
Depends: atop (>= ATOP_MAJMIN), atop (<< ATOP_NEXTMIN~), libc6, zlib1g
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/pizhenwei/atophttpd
Description: web style interface to atop (https://www.atoptool.nl)
 atophttpd depends on atop and reads atop rawlog, provides web
 service(HTTP 1.1). A user accesses atop by a web browser without
 login permission of a server, it's also possible to get/analysis
 statistics of many servers in batch.
 .
 Authors: zhenwei pi, Enhua Zhou
